<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani banks to close Saturday-Monday for Eid.</title>
<headline>Pakistani banks to close Saturday-Monday for Eid.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday all banks in the country would remain closed from Saturday to Monday because of public holidays declared by the government for the Moslem festival of Eid al-Fitr.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
